{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t中俄美元首昨天在深圳舉行三方會晤，美國總統特朗普及俄羅斯總統普京，都積極評價這次歷史性會晤。<br/>\n<br/>\n但特朗普表示，會上有關限制核武的討論，美方未必能夠落實。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:04:06.156890+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T11:43:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:30.831864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:57:22.905311+00:00","content_hash":"798157c0fbe12c812021b91b814fc35cf9a3a0ff595e469315003abaae878ef2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}